  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Selkirk College is located in the Kootenay region of British Columbia, Canada, and offers a diverse and supportive learning environment. Whether you're interested in pursuing a career in healthcare, technology, or outdoor recreation, Selkirk College provides an environment where you can grow both academically and personally.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>The Selkirk College Students’ Union is at the heart of student life, offering a variety of activities, events, and student clubs to help you connect with like-minded individuals. The International Office offers dedicated support to help you adjust to life in Canada.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Selkirk College offers a range of on-campus accommodation options, primarily for students studying at the Castlegar campus. Each room is furnished and has access to shared kitchens, study spaces, and common areas.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>If you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The library at Selkirk College is a hub of resources and study spaces, equipped with extensive print and digital collections to support your learning.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>You can join various sports or group activities, including dodgeball, volleyball, basketball, soccer and more.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>For programmes like Health &amp; Human Services, Trades, and Technology, Selkirk College offers specialised facilities to support your learning. This includes health simulation labs, workshops, and digital media studios.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>There are several dining options on campus, including a cafeteria that serves a variety of meals.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
